  usecase "SFR009: Find Contextualized News Relevant to Portfolio" as SFR009
  usecase "SFR010: Generate Client Dashboards with Financial Information" as SFR010
  usecase "SFR011: Extract Relevant Insights From Contextualized News for Users' Portfolios" as SFR011

  usecase "AIFR001: Analyze Historical Data and Market Trends to Generate Predictions" as AIFR001
  usecase "AIFR002: Create Personalized Recommendations Based on Financial Profiles" as AIFR002
